<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALY BEAT SPAIN 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALY BEAT SPAIN 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PESARO, Italy 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat Spain 4-1 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup world group quarter-final. They meet Sweden in</p>
<p>the semifinals on September 19-21.</p>
<p>Sunday's reverse singles (best-of-three sets):</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Marzio Martelli 7-6 (7-5) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Omar Camporese beat Albert Costa (Spain) 6-2 3-6 6-4</p>
</text>
